	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: POWER (SLUSE81F)\n1. Bypass caps as close as possible, REFHP most critical (10.1.2, p.205).\n2. Ground groups per table; islands on L1, join on L2 (10.1.1, Fig. 10-1,\n   p.203-204). NEG5V -> CVSS per 10.1.1 (Fig. 8-1 shows AVSS; same net).\n3. Q1 DPAK: >= 4 cm2 VCOLL copper on L1+L4, stitched; away from U1 and\n   R_CB. R20/R21 share dissipation (8.2.1.2.2, Fig. 8-3, p.193).\n4. Thermal pad: PAP0064F land pattern, vias tented/plugged\n   (pkg drawing notes 8-9, p.220)."
